# What Will My Students Create in Web Lab?

#### Let's begin with the end in mind! Here are some sample projects to help you see what your students will build toward throughout Web Development. Please note that these are end-of-Chapter 1 projects, meaning that students will have to progress through all of the lessons in Chapter 1 to build up to these programming skills.

#### Open up as many or as few sample projects as you want! Click on each example to review the sample project and its corresponding code. Focus *less* on the content and *more* on the way in which the content is structured and styled. We hope you enjoy exploring these projects and get excited to teach your students this content!

## Sample Student Projects

##### Click the images below to view the sample projects in a new tab.
<br>

